'' String slices (docs/tiko-slices RFC-0001): TKO1050, a source that cannot be sliced;
'' TKO1051, constant bounds outside 0 <= lo <= hi + 1 <= len (string*N is N, zstring*N holds
'' at most N - 1); TKO1052, a const slice where a mutable one is wanted -- initialiser,
'' assignment, argument. A write through a const slice is TKO0617; rebinding one is not, and
'' an empty 's[3 to 2]' is legal. P2b: TKO1053, a literal / another width / a
'' temporary for a MUTABLE slice parameter; TKO1052 for a const string there and for slice( p ) over
'' a const pointer; TKO1050 for slice( ) over a non-pointer.
'' TEST: cli
'' ARGS: --dump-ir tests/diagnostics/src/string-slices.tiko
'' EXPECT-EXIT: 1
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-slices.tiko(6,10): error TKO1050: 'double' cannot be sliced
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-slices.tiko(8,10): error TKO1051: slice 0 to 8 is outside 'f' (0 to 7)
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-slices.tiko(9,10): error TKO1051: slice -1 to 2 is outside 's' (0 to len - 1)
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-slices.tiko(10,10): error TKO1051: slice 5 to 2 is outside 's'
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-slices.tiko(11,20): error TKO1052: a const slice cannot convert to a mutable slice
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-slices.tiko(14,6): error TKO1052
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-slices.tiko(15,10): error TKO1052
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-slices.tiko(16,2): error TKO0617
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-slices.tiko(21,13): error TKO1051: slice 0 to 7 is outside 'z' (0 to 6)
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-slices.tiko(25,9): error TKO1053: a mutable slice parameter needs a string variable, not 'string'
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-slices.tiko(26,9): error TKO1053: a mutable slice parameter needs a string variable, not 'ustring'
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-slices.tiko(27,9): error TKO1052
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-slices.tiko(29,24): error TKO1052
'' EXPECT-OUT: string-slices.tiko(30,12): error TKO1050: 'double' cannot be sliced
'' EXPECT-MAX-DIAG: 14
